=== 1. Server env (this run) ===
apps/server started via: pnpm exec tsx src/index.ts (no --watch — tsx watch
restarts on any package/core|content file save, which killed an earlier
live-turn run mid-session when a concurrent lane edited shared packages;
switching off watch mode fixed that)

SOTTO_PORT=8792
SOTTO_HOST=0.0.0.0
SOTTO_STATIC_DIR=<repo>/apps/client/dist   (from `pnpm web:export`)
SOTTO_BASIC_AUTH=sotto:demo-only            (demo credential — never reuse)
SOTTO_STT_URL=https://api.openai.com/v1   SOTTO_STT_MODEL=whisper-1
SOTTO_LLM_URL=https://api.openai.com/v1   SOTTO_LLM_MODEL=gpt-4o-mini
SOTTO_TTS_URL=https://api.openai.com/v1   SOTTO_TTS_MODEL=tts-1
SOTTO_API_KEY=<from apps/server/.env, never printed>

=== 2. curl checks: Basic-auth guard + static route ===
$ curl -s -o /dev/null -w "%{http_code}\n" http://127.0.0.1:8792/health
200                                          (open with no credential)
$ curl -s -o /dev/null -w "%{http_code}\n" http://127.0.0.1:8792/
401                                          (protected, no credential)
$ curl -s -o /dev/null -w "%{http_code}\n" http://127.0.0.1:8792/content/packs
401
$ curl -s -o /dev/null -w "%{http_code}\n" -u sotto:demo-only http://127.0.0.1:8792/
200
$ curl -s -u sotto:demo-only http://127.0.0.1:8792/health
{"ok":true,"stt":true,"llm":true,"tts":true,"vad":"energy"}
$ curl -s -o /dev/null -w "%{http_code}\n" -u sotto:demo-only http://127.0.0.1:8792/content/packs
200

=== 3. Bugs found and fixed while proving Tier 2 live (see git log) ===
- fix(server): drop llama-server-only params (chat_template_kwargs,
  cache_prompt) when the LLM URL is api.openai.com — OpenAI's real
  /v1/chat/completions 400s on unrecognized arguments. First live attempt
  failed with:
    "LLM request failed: 400 ... Unrecognized request arguments supplied:
     cache_prompt, chat_template_kwargs"
- fix(server): use a valid OpenAI voice (alloy) and omit lang_code for TTS
  on api.openai.com — Kokoro's locale-mapped voice name (e.g. ef_dora) is
  not in OpenAI's voice enum. Second live attempt failed with:
    "TTS request failed: 400 ... Input should be 'nova', 'shimmer', 'echo',
     'onyx', 'fable', 'alloy', 'ash', 'sage' or 'coral'"
  Both fixes are conditional on the LLM/TTS URL's hostname, covered by
  apps/server/src/voice/llm.test.ts and tts.test.ts.

